      "text": [
        "Workshops and generators can be ranked, the same way Spiritgear is: seat the machine in Echo Attune, then Echo Bind, then Echo Manifest. Each rank makes it faster, and it pays for the speed in Pulse.",
        "You cannot skip a step: Bind refuses a rank 0 machine, and Manifest wants rank 2."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What ranking costs",
      "text": [
        "Each step takes Pulse and time, but no catalysts:",
        "- Attune (Fire): **16 seconds** at **96 Pulse a second**, for rank 1.",
        "- Bind (Water): **20 seconds** at **128**, for rank 2.",
        "- Manifest (Spirit): **24 seconds** at **160**, for rank 3."
      ]
    },
